\right) \right] \left( 
\begin{array}{ccc}
f_{1} & \cdots  & f_{r}%
\end{array}%
\right) \left( 
\begin{array}{ccc}
\mathcal{R}_{e}\left( A\right) _{1}^{1} & \cdots  & \mathcal{R}_{e}\left(
